{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And if it is on the bed.</b> The one who lies or sits on her bed or on her seat — even if he did not touch it — he too is in the category of impurity stated in the verse above, requiring washing of garments." "<b>Upon the vessel.</b> To include the riding-saddle." "<b>If he touches it.</b> It speaks only of the riding-saddle, which was included from ״upon the vessel.״" "<b>If he touches it he becomes impure.</b> And it does not require washing of garments, for the riding-saddle — its contact does not defile a person to defile garments (Kelim ch. 23)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:39.123570412Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}